! **Cr2O3, the canonical linear magnetoelectric**: the cell `PLAN.md` P57 moved to
! after AlAs's reachable column turned out to be forced to zero by symmetry.
!
! Corundum in the rhombohedral setting (`ibrav = 5`, the threefold axis along z),
! the experimental a = 4.9570 and c = 13.5923 Angstrom giving a_rh = 10.1271 bohr
! and alpha = 55.096 degrees. Cr at (t, t, t) with t = 0.1525, 0.3475, 0.6525,
! 0.8475 (the hexagonal z = 0.3475), O at the 6e positions with x = 0.5556. The
! Cr-O distances come out 1.964 and 2.013 Angstrom against the measured 1.965 and
! 2.016, and the volume 96.4 Angstrom^3.
!
! **The order is + - + - along the axis, and that is what makes it
! magnetoelectric.** Inversion (t -> 1 - t) pairs 0.1525 with 0.8475 and 0.3475
! with 0.6525, opposite spins in both pairs, so inversion and time reversal are
! each broken and their product is kept: a linear tensor is allowed with no base
! field, and alpha_zz along the moments is one of its two independent entries.
! The field along z is parallel to the moments, which is the column this code
! converges (P57's transverse runs plateau).
 &control
    calculation = 'scf'
 /
 &system
    ibrav = 5, celldm(1) = 10.1271, celldm(4) = 0.57237,
    nat = 10, ntyp = 3,
    ecutwfc = 48.0, ecutrho = 460.0,
    noncolin = .true., lspinorb = .true.,
    nosym = .true., noinv = .true.,
    starting_magnetization(1) = 0.2, angle1(1) = 0.0,
    starting_magnetization(2) = 0.2, angle1(2) = 180.0,
 /
 &electrons
    conv_thr = 1.0d-9
    mixing_beta = 0.3
 /
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 Cr1 51.996 Cr.rel-pbe-spn-rrkjus_psl.1.0.0.UPF
 Cr2 51.996 Cr.rel-pbe-spn-rrkjus_psl.1.0.0.UPF
 O   15.999 O.rel-pbe-n-rrkjus_psl.1.0.0.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
 Cr1  0.152500  0.152500  0.152500
 Cr2  0.347500  0.347500  0.347500
 Cr1  0.652500  0.652500  0.652500
 Cr2  0.847500  0.847500  0.847500
 O    0.555600  0.944400  0.250000
 O    0.250000  0.555600  0.944400
 O    0.944400  0.250000  0.555600
 O    0.444400  0.055600  0.750000
 O    0.750000  0.444400  0.055600
 O    0.055600  0.750000  0.444400
K_POINTS automatic
 4 4 4 0 0 0
